    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Sweet Lyoria</strong>, a charming and whimsical pixel art life simulation game where comfort, fantasy, and community bloom together. Nestled in a snow-kissed valley surrounded by magical woods, Sweet Lyoria is a place where time slows down and every interaction matters. Whether you're collecting new friends, placing homes, or work in places youve always wanted to. Sweet Lyoria invites you to create a world that feels like home.</p>",
